# ERP project memory — documentation gate

## ARCHITECTURE-PROTECTION-01 (active)

New modules: **models → services → tests → minimal Streamlit UI**. Business/accounting logic must not live in `app.py`. Pause deep Streamlit UI for auth, staff portal, uploads, approval workflows. See `ROADMAP.md` § ARCHITECTURE-PROTECTION-01.

## VENDOR-NEUTRAL-01 (active)

No vendor-specific core architecture. Generic external sources: free-text `source_name`, optional `source_type` (`POS`/`ERP`/`MANUAL`/…). No vendor enums, `if wolvox` branches, or named modules in core. Doc examples OK; user-typed names OK. Banking “POS Settlement” ≠ POS product. See `ROADMAP.md` § VENDOR-NEUTRAL-01; exemplar `docs/DAILY_SALES_CLOSE_01_SPEC.md`.

## MIGRATION-READINESS-01 (active)

Design `services/` for future FastAPI/React: explicit `company_id`/`user_id`, serializable DTOs (`to_dict()`), no Streamlit in services, pure `validate_*`/`compute_*`, tests without Streamlit, contract scans. Log debt in `docs/TECH_DEBT_AND_MIGRATION_CLEANUP.md`. Exemplar: DSC-P1 `services/daily_sales_close.py`. **End every implementation report with Migration Cleanup (5 sections)** — see TECH_DEBT template. See `ROADMAP.md` § MIGRATION-READINESS-01.

No task is **complete** until the docs under `docs/` are updated when applicable.

## When to update (required)

After every completed **feature**, **bug fix**, **accounting change**, **audit**, **migration**, or **major test addition** touching banking, reconciliation, company credit card, or related posting:

| Trigger | Update |
|---------|--------|
| Feature status changed (built / partial / deferred) | `docs/BANKING_RECON_CC_STATUS.md` |
| Any audit or fix session | `docs/AUDIT_HISTORY.md` (dated entry) |
| Accounting behavior or frozen rule changed | `docs/ACCOUNTING_DECISIONS.md` |
| Tests added, removed, or scope changed | `docs/TEST_COVERAGE_MAP.md` |
| Migration-prep or service-layer debt identified or resolved | `docs/TECH_DEBT_AND_MIGRATION_CLEANUP.md` |

## AUDIT_HISTORY entry template

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD — Short title

**Audit / task:** …
**Findings:** …
**Actions taken:** …
**Related tests:** …
```

## Do not

- Skip docs because the code change was "small"
- Mark todos complete before doc updates
- Change accounting behavior without recording decisions when behavior is intentional
- Put business logic in `app.py` for new modules (use `services/` per MIGRATION-READINESS-01)

## Doc locations

- `docs/BANKING_RECON_CC_STATUS.md` — status matrix, risks, do-not-rebuild, next task
- `docs/AUDIT_HISTORY.md` — chronological log
- `docs/ACCOUNTING_DECISIONS.md` — frozen rules (2110, 1150, Card vs Company CC, etc.)
- `docs/TEST_COVERAGE_MAP.md` — test file → feature map
- `docs/TECH_DEBT_AND_MIGRATION_CLEANUP.md` — migration and service-layer tech debt register
